<title>USA: Central U.S. carlot pork 1500 CST - USDA.</title>
<headline>Central U.S. carlot pork 1500 CST - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Compared to Tuesday's 3:00 PM close, fresh loins traded steady to 1.00 higher; butts mostly 2.00 lower; skinned hams 17-20 lbs. mostly 2.00 lower, 20-26 lbs steady; seedless bellies steady to 2.00 higher; trimmings steady to 1.00 higher. Trading was moderate to active, with light to moderate demand and mostly moderate offerings, except light loin offerings, according to USDA.</p>
